flowchart TD
  U[User or application] --> L{Natural language?}
  L -->|Yes| AI[Optional reasoning agent]
  L -->|No: typed task| PB[Proposal boundary]
  U -->|Direct props and controls| UI[Owned primitive and 2D UI]
  AI --> PB
  CAT[Authorized Catalog] --> B[Bind and validate]
  PB --> B
  B -->|Invalid / denied / choice / meaning / stale| F[Diagnostic and manual path]
  B -->|Bound| K{Data required?}
  K -->|No| PR[Existing results or form schema]
  K -->|Yes| Q[Logical plan and capability budget]
  Q --> EX[Application Data Contract executor]
  EX --> R[Named Results: grain scope versions lineage]
  R -->|Evaluate / inspect| AI
  R --> PR
  PR --> PC[Presentation compiler]
  EP[Experience and environment] --> PC
  PC --> CA[Patterns OR bounded new composition OR proposal]
  CA --> FE[Feasibility and task-operation coverage]
  FE --> C[Recheck read set and authority then commit]
  C --> UI
  UI --> IN[Typed interaction and state preservation]
  IN -->|Local delta| UI
  IN -->|Authorized materialization or task change| Q
